OL,5,G0232 The Climate Question
OL,6,     FAs heatwaves increase, air
OL,7,     Fconditioning is becoming less of a
OL,8,     Fluxury and more a lifeline. But
OL,9,     Fwhat about its climate impact?
OL,10,G0300 BBC News
OL,11,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,12,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,13,G0306 Outlook
OL,14,     FAfter Nemonte Nenquimo saw the
OL,15,     Fdestruction the oil industry was
OL,16,     Fbringing to the Amazon, she fought
OL,17,     Fback and won a landmark legal
OL,18,     Fvictory protecting 500,000 acres
OL,19,     Fof rainforest.
